<https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2012-01-12/12-05#chp_5> a dzdoc:Chapter ;
    dzdoc:containedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2012-01-12/12-05> ;
    dzdoc:directlyContainedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/organic-law/2012-01-12/12-05#body> ;
